msgstr "Varning: Potentiellt osäker inklistring"

#: src/apprt/gtk/class/clipboard_confirmation_dialog.zig:397
msgid ""
"Pasting this text into the terminal may be dangerous as it looks like some "
"commands may be executed."
msgstr ""
"Att klistra in texten i terminalen kan vara farligt eftersom det ser ut som "
"att kommandon kan köras."

